    description_en: "This Two-Face minifigure from 2012 perfectly captures Harvey Dent's tragic transformation with his distinctive orange and purple two-toned suit representing his split personality. The figure features printed dual-sided face detailing showing the handsome district attorney on one side and the scarred criminal on the other, embodying Gotham's fallen hero. As one of Batman's most psychologically complex villains, Two-Face makes all decisions based on the flip of a coin, torn between his former ideals and criminal impulses. This early Super Heroes release showcases LEGO's ability to portray tragic villain origin stories through detailed minifigure design.",
